.TH CIRCLETRACE 1
.SH NAME
circletrace \- circle tracing game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/circletrace
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I CircleTrace
is a circle tracing game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Drag button 1 around the guide circle.
A status line at the top left shows the running average radial error,
elapsed time, and score.
The score is elapsed time multiplied by average error per pixel of path,
so a trace must be both fast and accurate; lower is better.
An attempt only counts if the traced path is at least 95% of the
guide circle's circumference; shorter traces sound a low failure tone
and are discarded.
A new best score plays a three-beep jingle and is saved across runs;
background music plays while tracing.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB drag
Draw freehand around guide circle; release scores
.TP
.B Enter / r
Reset
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/circletrace.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
